# Cheque-OCR Reference Implementation

This repository provides a reproducible multi-stage pipeline (preprocessing → segmentation → refinement → recognition).
It includes:
- code and configs
- synthetic data generator for reproducibility
- instructions to integrate private datasets

## Reproducibility / Data Availability
Per the journal's requirement (Editor & reviewers' comments), all code, configs and training scripts are provided. If your dataset is private (bank cheque images), add it to `data/train`, `data/val`, `data/test`. If data cannot be published, upload synthetic dataset (provided) and provide contact/procedure to obtain original dataset in your paper.

Suggested data access statement for your manuscript:

> The original cheque dataset contains sensitive financial information and cannot be publicly released. To facilitate reproducibility, we provide: (1) the full implementation and pretrained weights in `weights/`, (2) a synthetic dataset generator to reproduce experiments, and (3) a data request procedure: authorized researchers may request access by contacting the corresponding author (email) under a data-sharing agreement. 

